    "jumanji": "ImportError: the Jumanji family builds its per-pixel atlas by CALLING the official matplotlib viewer, so it cannot render without the reference package: missing jumanji. The envs were measured in /mnt/vast/home/randall.balestriero/venvs/se-jumanji, built with a CLEAN `python -m venv` \u2014 a --system-site-packages venv breaks jax's CUDA plugin discovery. See docs/research/jumanji.md",
