    "overcooked": "ImportError: jaxmarl is not importable (ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'jaxmarl'). The atlas IS jaxmarl's own `_render_tile` output \u2014 nothing here re-derives it \u2014 so there is no degraded mode. `pip install jaxmarl` (measured against jaxmarl 0.1.0 / jax 0.4.38) INTO A CLEAN VENV: a `python -m venv --system-site-packages` venv breaks jax's CUDA plugin discovery.",
